    <guid isPermaLink="false">683fc3f131215eb5063731ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Jun 2025 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📒【本期主题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>被某位网红老师所诟病成“天坑”的新闻学，到底“天坑”在哪里？是否存在你不了解的另一面？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天老师就和同学们一起聊一聊新闻学专业~</span></p><span></span><p><span>✨【本期亮点导航】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 为什么选择新闻学这个专业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="323">05:23</a> 新闻学专业的学生毕业后能干些啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a> 那些新闻学专业背后 你不了解的闪光点！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 面试官不会告诉你的小tips！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> 存不存在“天坑”专业？</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏺️【主播简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>尔雅老师 北京某高校副教授、硕导，学术类知识头部博主，梅森出版集团创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬【本期分享内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《新闻编辑室》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《早间主播》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《新闻女王》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《黑镜系列》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《The Happy Junimo &nbsp;Show Theme》—— ConcernedApe</span></p><span></span><p><span>✉️【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号&amp;微博 | @高校不搞笑</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书 | @尔雅老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>抖音 | @梅森学术</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时欢迎大家通过邮箱（zhengkinkin02@163.com）积极来信反馈或投稿噢！</span></p>]]></description>
