  <item>
    <title>E06.泰国读博，不止划算那么简单！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/655d958951ba721857175922</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">655d958951ba721857175922</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Nov 2023 05:45:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你有没有在网络上听说过泰国生活的那些匪夷所思的事？泰国真的就如同传闻所言安全系数特别低，不适合中国学生留学深造吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>答案当然是：拜托，你真的是想得太多了！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>去泰国读书除了你以为的留学成本低以外，还有很多优势！这当然也会成为你人生中为数不多地静下心来沉淀自我的经历。</span><em><strong><span>总之，不管去哪里读博，读博的成果最终都是由自己来决定的，你所向往的地方一定会在某一天成为你的终点。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>如果你还在担心，那就不妨听一听本期播客，揭开泰国读博的面纱！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客我们邀请到了王老师，他曾经一段时间在泰国读博。我们将跟他一起聊一聊有关泰国读博的经历与体会。欢迎大家耐心收听！有问题也可以在评论区留言哦，主播会不定期掉落回复哦！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🌟【本期亮点导航】</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 选择泰国读博都有哪些考虑因素呢？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a>留学中介宣传的泰国学制与中国完全错开是真的吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a>申请博士都需要什么条件？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>泰国也要求发scopos论文吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a>在泰国“反向留学”的情况也很常见吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a>如何看待周围对于泰国“水博”、“不安全”的争议</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a>在泰国主要的研究方向</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a>定性还是定量研究更受欢迎？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>⏺️【参与录制人员】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>主播 | 尔雅老师 北京某高校副教授、硕导，学术类知识头部博主，梅森出版集团创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 | 王老师 泰国高校博士毕业</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🔗【延伸阅读与链接】</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://m.lizhiweike.com/channel2/277844" data-url="https://m.lizhiweike.com/channel2/277844"><span>Rebecca老师的英文论文写作课程</span></a><span>（指路第6期节目）</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6537c5d148a62918d03f7054" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6537c5d148a62918d03f7054"><span>与黄思华老师的对谈</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><strong><span>📺【本期分享内容】</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292720/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/1292720/"><span>电影《阿甘正传》</span></a><span>（1994）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>（可在评论区添加小助手vx获取）</span></em></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>🎵【本期音乐】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>《Monologue》——</span><em><span>SheHerHerHers</span></em></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>✉️【联系我们】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>公众号&amp;微博 | </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6524747959" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6524747959"><span>@高校不搞笑</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书 | </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5dc8fc62000000000100a7df?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d02482a0000000011013314&amp;apptime=1697620070" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5dc8fc62000000000100a7df?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d02482a0000000011013314&amp;apptime=1697620070"><span>@尔雅老师</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>抖音 | </span><a href="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAIfrqEwxMLlajxmUXXxSUEhRQ1GfPj_d4kGYH4Bxas-w" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAIfrqEwxMLlajxmUXXxSUEhRQ1GfPj_d4kGYH4Bxas-w"><span>@梅森学术</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>同时欢迎大家通过邮箱（jintianyigaoxueshu@163.com）积极来信反馈或投稿噢！</span></p>]]></description>
